        "original_id": "8b9b19ac-218e-5795-a41a-3cc41887c1f7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Feodor Chin, David Huynh, Stephane Gauger\n- Companies: Blizzard Entertainment, Activision Blizzard\n- Products: Overwatch, Chinatown Squad\n- Places: Irvine, California, San Francisco Chinatown\n- Roles: Zenyatta, Fong, Pistol Pete\n\nFacts:\n- Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. is an American video game developer and publisher based in Irvine, California, and it is a subsidiary of Activision Blizzard.\n- Feodor Chin voices Zenyatta in Blizzard Entertainment's game Overwatch.\n- Chinatown Squad is a pilot about 1890s San Francisco Chinatown.\n- David Huynh appears as the protagonist Fong in Chinatown Squad.\n- Stephane Gauger directed and produced Chinatown Squad.\n- Feodor Chin wrote Chinatown Squad and stars in it as the antagonist Pistol Pete.",
